177	    /**
178	     * Maps an owner to its DTO and stamps on the two derived values the mapper cannot produce on its own, each because
179	     * it depends on more than the single owner: the {@code identityKey} (see
180	     * {@link IdentityKeyResolver#deriveIdentityKey}), which is not a stored field of the owner, and the household-capped
181	     * {@code membershipLevel} (see {@link #cappedMembershipLevel}), which the mapper derives from the owner alone but
182	     * which the ceiling rule then caps against the owner's fellow household members. The capped level replaces the
183	     * mapper's uncapped one on the returned DTO.
